# 0333 = 0332i + IRQ port events, unified port state machine and
# suspend/resume behavior.  Everything is gated:
#   rubyusb_hotplug=1  LINK speed-change + MAC2 suspend/resume events,
#                      ruby_port_event state machine, workloop reattach
#   rubyusb_susp=1     U2 suspend freezes the QMU kicks and SOF watchdog,
#                      resume re-kicks non-destructively
# Both default 0; hotplug=0 is byte-equivalent to 0332i behavior.
#
# Verified on the device: 10/10 PnP re-enumeration, default A/B, and two
# suspend enter/exit cycles.  Selective suspend was NOT measured (the
# host power scheme exposes no matching setting); no availability
# guarantee is made for host-initiated suspend/resume.
#
# patchset d4a416830502e67244fecd8adddc1f0917edc3fc5a300aace6e359f9ebf9186b
# (304 files; 0001-0079 baseline + project patches through 0333)
